  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your retinue of followers has attracted some skilled individuals you can call on in a time of need.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Leadership sphere ((follower) package), call in a specialist logistic specialty.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using your call in a specialist logistic specialty, you may recruit a specialist from your followers so that the specialist appears in half the time they’d normally take to arrive. For example, a level 11 commander recruits an equipment specialist, who arrives in 6.5 hours instead of 13.</p>\n<p>In addition, whenever your followers attempt a skill check using your ranks or bonus in Diplomacy, they gain a +2 bonus on that check. If you have 10 or more ranks in Diplomacy, this bonus increases to +4.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc56\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
